      },
      "removed_new_resolving_aliases": [
        "Rumen fluid, clarified (see Medium No. 266)"
      ],
      "correction": "The existing Clarified_rumen_fluid owner spans processed ruminal fluid. Its MICRO0000520 exact target requires cow origin, but primary DSMZ161/212 expressly allow cow OR sheep, while JCM266/355/1201 do not state an animal species. Reuse the existing processed-fluid owner with a local registry identity rather than create a duplicate or infer cow. This is a variable biological material, not an assertion that every source preparation has identical species or composition. JCM266 and DSMZ161 processing details remain distinct supplied forms; no unprocessed rumen-fluid equivalence is asserted."
